text_sequence = Array[String](["I found a rental house. The rent is incredibly cheap.", "It’s close to my job—that’s a plus.", "My boss introduced me to the landlord. He promised me a cozy place to stay. The landlord seemed friendly enough.", "The only thing I found strange was when I asked about the previous tenants… he avoided the question.", "But whatever—I’ll find out soon enough.", "Time to pack my things and move in."])

